[{"client_msg_id":"1ea360f6-b853-43ce-a816-68beb14db62a","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"基本的に仕事は好きですけど、難しいとかではなく色々と理不尽な案件にブチ当たった時だけは働きたくねぇ・・・ってなります","ts":"1617199698.118100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]},{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cjZH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"377429d9-02e3-4b6c-800d-7490fba3dfff","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"15年以上前から竹皮草履を使っています。今４代目かな？　破片が出るので掃除機かけなきゃという気にもなります。 \u003chttps://item.rakuten.co.jp/taketora/zo00003/\u003e","ts":"1617187088.116300","thread_ts":"1617181314.099600","attachments":[{"fallback":"楽天市場: 【楽天市場】【国産】熟練の職人が地元産竹皮を使い日本伝統の技で編み上げた竹皮健康草履（ぞうり）特大サイズ 28cm：虎斑竹専門店　竹虎","id":1,"title":"【楽天市場】【国産】熟練の職人が地元産竹皮を使い日本伝統の技で編み上げた竹皮健康草履（ぞうり）特大サイズ 28cm：虎斑竹専門店　竹虎","title_link":"https://item.rakuten.co.jp/taketora/zo00003/","text":"竹皮草履（ぞうり）/草鞋（わらじ） 28cmサイズ。【国産】熟練の職人が地元産竹皮を使い日本伝統の技で編み上げた竹皮健康草履（ぞうり）特大サイズ 28cm","thumb_url":"https://shop.r10s.jp/taketora/cabinet/item/zo00003.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"楽天市場","service_icon":"https://item.rakuten.co.jp/favicon.ico","thumb_width":750,"thumb_height":750,"from_url":"https://item.rakuten.co.jp/taketora/zo00003/","original_url":"https://item.rakuten.co.jp/taketora/zo00003/"}],"subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HLN"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"2BC08043-CE12-4072-AEA9-AB4C2BCE3D27","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"話変わるんですけど、最近足首付近の筋が張って、痛くなるのに悩まされていたんですけど、今日ふと部屋で履いているスリッパが合ってないのでは？と思ってきました。","ts":"1617181314.099600","thread_ts":"1617181314.099600","reply_count":2,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QK1Ii"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"a5a84d6f-9209-45ea-844f-c6046744af4b","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"\u003chttps://www.nikkei.com/article/DGXLZO90471720S5A810C1TI5000/\u003e","ts":"1617184969.116000","attachments":[{"fallback":"日本経済新聞: 若者の3割「できれば働きたくない」　電通調べ","id":1,"title":"若者の3割「できれば働きたくない」　電通調べ","title_link":"https://www.nikkei.com/article/DGXLZO90471720S5A810C1TI5000/","text":"若者の3割が「できれば働きたくない」と考えていることが電通の仕事に関する意識調査で分かった。7割が働く目的を「安定した収入のため」と答えており、仕事を生活のためと割り切る傾向が鮮明になっている。週3日以上働いている18～29歳の男女計3000人を対象に、今年3月にインターネットで調査した。「働くのは当たり前」という回答が39%だったのに対して、「できれば働きたくない」も29%に達した。働く目","thumb_url":"https://www.nikkei.com/.resources/k-components/rectangle.rev-b4d855d.png","blocks":null,"ts":1439392355,"service_name":"日本経済新聞","service_icon":"https://www.nikkei.com/.resources/k-components/180.rev-79352c3.png","thumb_width":1024,"thumb_height":630,"from_url":"https://www.nikkei.com/article/DGXLZO90471720S5A810C1TI5000/","original_url":"https://www.nikkei.com/article/DGXLZO90471720S5A810C1TI5000/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZH7oU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3cf40bb0-d408-42d2-ace8-6e3e83c8eac1","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"終身かはともかく、雇用主と被雇用者の差があるので、あのへん調整が難しいですよね...","ts":"1617183071.115500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Mag"}]},{"client_msg_id":"156F5FFB-DB0F-4CD1-861E-C2285310684C","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"いまの収入を維持しつつ、時間を確保したければ、時給上げるしかないですね。あとは、日本の雇用法が悪いので、終身雇用制度を滅ぼさない限り、週40時間の原則はなかなか変えられないんですよね。","ts":"1617182883.114700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LrtR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bc5fc116-578f-41be-93e7-34dd17846686","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"正直給料が少なめだろうが、各種福祉や事務考えると安いと思ってたりはする(自分の実力なら)","ts":"1617182858.114000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3aSI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"44dd476a-f2c9-4ee8-b044-3c6e33b0975f","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"自由傭兵じゃなくて、無料傭兵になるとヤバいですからね","ts":"1617182820.112400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aXURH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1bf1c61b-2abd-4c30-bd1c-1ca0ee48a91e","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"少なくとも自分は全く向いてないと思うし","ts":"1617182818.112100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":1,"users":["U03C71D7H"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xjqEH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ebbf889c-61e5-40b2-bb4b-7d5adb0c81c1","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"フリーランス、なると不幸になる人が一定数いる気がするのでなぁ","ts":"1617182784.110800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dQB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fd7d3c66-9255-4c47-b667-bc88ccdb41a6","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"まあ口だけの時点でお察しですがw 本気でやるならフリーランスになるとか選択肢はあるわけで\nなんかまた喚いてるな、くらいに眺めておいてもらえると…","ts":"1617182753.110300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Wt1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d5c79637-60b8-4e9c-842e-f3b08a24e4c9","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあ、機密なエリアとかは仕事じゃないと行けないよな、はありますな。","ts":"1617182710.109200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ipiz+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1950cef6-5c64-4280-9132-432ab9551623","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"私の場合は正確には、仕事自体は別に嫌いではないけど仕事以外にやりたいことが多すぎてそれに対して仕事の比率が高すぎるので減らしたい…という感じですね","ts":"1617182698.108900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FhA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f02983c-70aa-4d1e-ac16-37fdea96fc69","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"こんなの個人ではほぼ無理。\n\n\u003chttps://twitter.com/mattn_jp/status/1367900550751133697\u003e","ts":"1617182657.107900","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/mattn_jp|@mattn_jp\u003e: わーいCPUコア、あかりCPUコアだいすきー \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/EvvB_KEVcAAGvLD.png\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"mattn","author_subname":"@mattn_jp","author_link":"https://twitter.com/mattn_jp/status/1367900550751133697","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1361128357698572292/61_qdnll_normal.jpg","text":"わーいCPUコア、あかりCPUコアだいすきー \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/EvvB_KEVcAAGvLD.png\u003e","image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/EvvB_KEVcAAGvLD.png","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1614967880,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/mattn_jp/status/1367900550751133697","original_url":"https://twitter.com/mattn_jp/status/1367900550751133697"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Lma"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d4d674eb-d253-4dd1-81ee-53a5bd60ef3a","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"仕事でしか触れない環境とかあるしなぁ。","ts":"1617182625.106900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":2,"users":["U7B4ZD49X","UFHQ7TNT0"]},{"name":"tashikani","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WAozY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c3a9e82f-e2f6-40b9-a6af-6bef70a58218","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"歳をとって今まであった興味や意欲がなくなっていく可能性は否定できない。それは未来の話なので現時点ではわからないですね。","ts":"1617182618.106800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tgcS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b8fd5fe6-bb97-4c06-905d-f697b20eb157","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"エンジニアに限って学ぶことがなくなるなんてことが果たしてありえるんだろうか","ts":"1617182573.106000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"C5r"}]},{"client_msg_id":"332f65ef-06bf-4007-840f-5c3460e41d51","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","tex