lock_id":"1wnl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"65e3be93-76b0-47c1-b116-b9310bbc8736","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"生活にメリハリ付けたいというのは分かる","ts":"1617182224.102000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ge/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6bd9e8ff-9c9e-40ab-8ec1-c021de447f32","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"根が社会不適合者なので働きたいという気持ちは一生理解できないだろうなと思ってる","ts":"1617182212.101800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FD+uB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a2dca106-46a2-4a5f-af0b-d2a397183368","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"掃除はしてもホコリはあるのでスリッパ、というのは一定数いると思います。\n自分も、あと足元の保温(冬)/乾燥(夏)","ts":"1617181593.101300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":2,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0","UGXMRNBUM"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6o+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"96474fa0-8e45-4e9d-9b68-fa1eca99309d","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"部屋でスリッパ履いてるんですね・・・\nもしかして今バスローブですか？あとワイン？","ts":"1617181503.100500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"blob_wine","count":2,"users":["U03C6TEAZ","U72TB62UF"]},{"name":"fuita","count":2,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0","UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"r/Kgs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2BC08043-CE12-4072-AEA9-AB4C2BCE3D27","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"話変わるんですけど、最近足首付近の筋が張って、痛くなるのに悩まされていたんですけど、今日ふと部屋で履いているスリッパが合ってないのでは？と思ってきました。","ts":"1617181314.099600","thread_ts":"1617181314.099600","reply_count":2,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QK1Ii"}]},{"client_msg_id":"B2DAA176-69DF-4929-93B2-B55C5DCDBD06","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"だんだんやることがなくなってきて、早寝早起きになり、5時、6時には起きて散歩がてらコンビニに立ち読みとか行くようになるんですよ。お年寄りがなぜ朝早く徘徊しているのかよく分かりました。","ts":"1617179249.097100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":4,"users":["UAZ33BKV2","U7B4ZD49X","U03C6TEAZ","UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VOT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c86a578c-c58a-48df-87eb-9439f5be80a9","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"無職経験無いので分からない。","ts":"1617178572.095000","edited":{"user":"U03C6TEAZ","ts":"1617178582.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gjz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"87BD6934-1581-4D5F-BC66-223CE6E8BEB1","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"無職って3ヶ月くらいで飽きるんですよねー","ts":"1617178508.094700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6uA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"13503be1-4f85-4b63-a625-42a8c511e958","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"私も仕事はあったほうが良い派ですが、どちらかというとメリハリが欲しいからですね。\n「夏休みがあるのはうれしいが、365日夏休み状態だったらかえって楽しくない」みたいな。","ts":"1617178369.094000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["UAZ33BKV2","U76GA7MFA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bfcw1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"569a4a44-d59d-4204-8ba0-c812d0d41f74","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"その他のことと体調体力考えると、仕事を減らしたい-\u0026gt;究極働きたくない(ほかのことしたい)みたいなのはあるんじゃないかな..と","ts":"1617178340.093400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xrK8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8D176C7F-0B07-4204-9C8F-14409B691E32","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"まぁ、僕の場合は気分によって月に200時間超えたり、逆に50時間以下だったりするから、例外なのは自覚してますけど、逆に言えばそういう選択をしたお陰でストレスなくやれているのかなとは思います。","ts":"1617178267.092200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=nq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7863d74b-991a-4c74-8fc9-01605c64b0d7","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"働くの自体はアリだけど、生活をそれで支えるよりは(他で支えて)働きたくない、みたいな...むずかしいけど。","ts":"1617178229.092100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vvT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"68612596-67d1-4771-bdf6-24a6d18c7299","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"これは奥さんにも言ってるけど、僕は宝くじ当たったり不労所得的な物が手に入っても、たぶん働くと思う。","ts":"1617177859.088600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":4,"users":["U7B4ZD49X","UFHQ7TNT0","UAZ33BKV2","U01J7703PFT"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eoGc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5c74fe28-2a0d-4520-8bfc-613b1ff62794","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"週に実働できる時間ってまあ言っても100時間くらいでその半分近くが仕事ですからね〜\nもうちょい落とせば平和になれそう","ts":"1617177706.087700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KC6EG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6bfaf43b-32cb-4952-82d1-750620ba4f96","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"私も働くのそんなに嫌いじゃないですけど（じゃないと暇になりそう）ちょっと量が多いなとは感じてます・・・１日減らせばいいくらいになりそう","ts":"1617177559.086500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VHV6j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2793630A-4C6F-4201-8F9F-1CF0C2DB58B2","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"働きたくないという人の気持ちが本当に理解できないんですけど、やっぱり楽しくないんですかね？\n僕の場合は、ゲームする、読書する、アニメ見る、料理する、仕事する、全部同じ感覚で楽しんでやってし、飽きたらやめるだけなんだけど、はたで見てると仕事だけ特別扱いしているように見えるのがよく分かんないんですよね。","ts":"1617177330.085600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Szg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"46b0ff27-86fe-40de-9824-57a7601a237a","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"明日から新職場であるのは事実であり、それはそれとして働かずに済むならそれが一番よいとは常々思っています。","ts":"1617176433.079500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3FF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fecda735-d7af-4b4d-9f87-197419edd96a","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text"